    // answers an ENCODED list instead: LIST_MARK followed by each field and a "\x01" after it.
    // The trailing separator makes the empty list (LIST_MARK) and the one-empty-field list
    // (LIST_MARK "\x01") different, which is what makes `a=($empty)` produce no element at all.
    // Inside a field a "\x02" escapes the character after it, so a field can hold "\x01" and
    // "\x02" themselves. LIST_MARK is U+DFFF, which no value can start with: a byte becomes
